# Language Conventions

- **README.md**: Write and update in **American English** only.
- **Code comments**: All comments (inline, block, JSDoc/TSDoc, etc.) must be **American English**.
- **Chat**: When the user writes in **German**, reply in **German**. Repo-facing prose above still follows English rules for README and comments.
